### Manual tests for the API (VS Code extension: REST Client).
### Start the API first: dotnet run --project backend/src/Commerce.Api
### Run the requests from top to bottom on an empty database.
### Every request except login and health needs the token that request 1 saves in @token.
### Users for development: admin / Admin#2026 and analista / Analista#2026 (see SECURITY.md).
### A load saves every record in the commerce table. Processing a date checks the name and the number
### of each record and moves the ones that fail to quarantine. Login, logout, uploads and processing are
### saved in the audit_log table.

@host = http://localhost:5080

### 0a. Without a session -> 401 "Debe iniciar sesión para continuar."
GET {{host}}/api/commerce

### 0b. Wrong password -> 401 "Usuario o contraseña incorrectos." (saved as LoginFailed)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "wrong" }

### 1. Login -> 200 with accessToken (the token is kept in @token for the next requests)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin#2026" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 2. Base file -> 201, insertedCount 10
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/files
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FormBoundary

--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="commerce_15032024.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../database/samples/valid-comma/commerce_15032024.csv
--FormBoundary--

### 3. Same file again -> 409 "Hay registros que ya existen en el sistema (fecha|código): ..."
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/files
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FormBoundary

--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="commerce_15032024.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../database/samples/valid-comma/commerce_15032024.csv
--FormBoundary--

### 4. Records of the date before processing -> 200, 10 records
GET {{host}}/api/commerce?processDate=2024-03-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Process 15/03 -> 200, quarantinedCount 5
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "processDate": "2024-03-15" }

### 6. Process the same date again -> 200, quarantinedCount 0
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "processDate": "2024-03-15" }

### 7. Records of the date after processing -> 200, 5 records (the correct ones)
GET {{host}}/api/commerce?processDate=2024-03-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Quarantine of the date -> 200, 5 records with motivo (row 1010 has 3 reasons)
GET {{host}}/api/commerce/quarantine?processDate=2024-03-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. All quarantine
GET {{host}}/api/commerce/quarantine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Wrong date format -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "processDate": "15/03/2024" }

### 11. Missing date -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/process
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 12. Semicolon and dd/MM/yyyy dates -> 201, insertedCount 10
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/files
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FormBoundary

--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="commerce_16032024.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../database/samples/valid-semicolon/commerce_16032024.csv
--FormBoundary--

### 13. All records correct -> 201, insertedCount 10. Process 2024-03-21: quarantinedCount 0
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/files
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FormBoundary

--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="commerce_21032024.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../database/samples/all-correct/commerce_21032024.csv
--FormBoundary--

### 14. Text with SQL and HTML -> 201, insertedCount 5. Stored as plain text. Process 2024-03-22: quarantinedCount 1
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/files
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FormBoundary

--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="commerce_22032024.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../database/samples/injection-attempt/commerce_22032024.csv
--FormBoundary--

