### 19. All records in the commerce table
GET {{host}}/api/commerce
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Wrong date format in the query -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/commerce?processDate=15/03/2024
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Logout -> 204. The token stops working: the next request answers 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "manual" }

### 22. Same token after the logout -> 401 "Su sesión ha expirado o no es válida. Inicie sesión de nuevo."
GET {{host}}/api/commerce
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. Health check (open, no session needed)
GET {{host}}/health
